-- The Archiving spine card for eleven countries. GENERATED by
-- tools/archiving-cards.mjs -- re-run the tool rather than editing this.
--
-- Ten of these already carried a retention row, filed inside their
-- "Mandatory content" card. That row is MOVED here in all four
-- languages rather than copied, so nothing is duplicated and nothing
-- is lost. The period row is written from each country's verified
-- headline fact and deliberately paraphrases rather than repeats the
-- archiving tile a few centimetres above it.
--
-- Cyprus says it does not know, which is the framework's rule about a
-- heading with nothing under it working as intended.

